{
 "batchId": "b-0112",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "ja",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_820fde236567eaed74cb",
   "sourceHash": "820fde236567eaed74cb9b8420329729069b1ef297c96ef5e9c7dcb25369679b",
   "text": "施術中に行われること",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_00ea70486dabbf3a3c9c",
   "sourceHash": "00ea70486dabbf3a3c9cdddb24c56fd9a47f59145eda9ce79187157b35657292",
   "text": "パンチャカルマの5つの療法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d5d69d37070087dc75c6",
   "sourceHash": "d5d69d37070087dc75c6207df34c7a149bf80ee714c1debed62a1d33a3473fab",
   "text": "パンチャ（5つ）＋カルマ（行為）＝パンチャカルマ[[TAG_1]]古代ヴェーダの手法に基づくパンチャカルマの浄化プロセスは、心と体を浄化します。5つの浄化プロセスを通じて毒素を排出します。わずか3週間で、健やかで幸せな、満たされた気持ちを感じられます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3392917ceb5fe43d46e3",
   "sourceHash": "3392917ceb5fe43d46e3963cb88a77ac6e802197e2336817fcdd6a1d08eb9766",
   "text": "ヴァマナム",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit therapy name transliterated into katakana."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d3d7930cfb1aea268cff",
   "sourceHash": "d3d7930cfb1aea268cff40cbc9eba0177802cbc38670bcc6cdd81b83e392216a",
   "text": "催吐（嘔吐）によってカパ・ドーシャのバランスを整え、酸素の取り込みを促し、免疫力を高めます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2377f50c7d95af6fe4fb",
   "sourceHash": "2377f50c7d95af6fe4fb66d3f4ea13ee884d7076265b691a19979da2525b58c9",
   "text": "ヴィレーチャン",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit therapy name transliterated into katakana."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f77a2bf75aad21415de",
   "sourceHash": "0f77a2bf75aad21415de6955bcac5f381a956db5755da9a6425a5020b20d9716",
   "text": "瀉下によってピッタ・ドーシャのバランスを整え、免疫力を高め、腸の吸収・分泌・代謝のはたらきを強化し、体に酸素を行き渡らせます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_36c4233e71e604dfc978",
   "sourceHash": "36c4233e71e604dfc978c6136833a28d5df691504276273868534c7518a76e49",
   "text": "ヴァスティ",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit therapy name transliterated into katakana."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_48399a5837d18cfed432",
   "sourceHash": "48399a5837d18cfed4324b5f1380c9831740ef988ab2346002312dbd6e1fc952",
   "text": "ヴァータ・ドーシャのバランスを整え、体に栄養を与え、若返りを促し、解毒し、神経系を強化します。あらゆる療法の王とされ、さまざまな疾患を速やかに治療・予防します。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf3e85a43f4a2bf8f1fc",
   "sourceHash": "cf3e85a43f4a2bf8f1fc58991dbf7c5a84749f3d4ccb99c9a0547ced8dae5463",
   "text": "ナスヤム",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit therapy name transliterated into katakana."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3538b00f6de9f7af8e77",
   "sourceHash": "3538b00f6de9f7af8e77a41a8c1dc7ddcf1b453ee02efcd869a7d5ee4e914ea2",
   "text": "上気道を浄化し、体の若返りを促して栄養を与えます。解毒と神経系の強化を助け、頭部および首の部位の不調を治療・予防します。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b6a817051756a7f75f8",
   "sourceHash": "4b6a817051756a7f75f8f75df480347eaaf385a931be4e8e445fb56d15c28a94",
   "text": "ラクタモークシャナ",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit therapy name transliterated into katakana."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9a09c2a755def3f2f5b7",
   "sourceHash": "9a09c2a755def3f2f5b799c726eee87a541d4e00da76428569830ec7a35303a5",
   "text": "ヒル、針、または角を用いて体から悪い血を取り除くプロセスです。血液を浄化し、血行を促進し、健康な組織を汚染から守ります。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_632898deb9abba462f2d",
   "sourceHash": "632898deb9abba462f2de6d2b027dad48787870ddd81dd161d16ce2beb2cbba5",
   "text": "まだ迷っていますか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_af3f72554a4897fb0f8b",
   "sourceHash": "af3f72554a4897fb0f8bc9d7c3e676717451477feea412af81df098e475bd297",
   "text": "パンチャカルマ療法が必要な理由",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eee1697c1fc146ea7f40",
   "sourceHash": "eee1697c1fc146ea7f401ee1d69421b7b6c20b3c2c9e6f17f79dc92a4f45043d",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]体に多くの毒素が蓄積している。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a273e64fb089ab557c50",
   "sourceHash": "a273e64fb089ab557c50344a7ed3c2fb99b1327393c6d93e40887a05670450b9",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]消化管の調子が整っていない",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_debb506e3f93761c5a6c",
   "sourceHash": "debb506e3f93761c5a6c8c840b263d6a0aeef650a5d3d98a90cec703a9b2780c",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]頭痛、関節の痛み、精神的な疲労、眠気、ストレス、倦怠感などの症状がある。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f04d9db3271d1d429e4b",
   "sourceHash": "f04d9db3271d1d429e4b44685af98d40e1b35a533991139137cae1509b1b24a0",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]運動やヨガをしていない。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aff534b9dd3af53156be",
   "sourceHash": "aff534b9dd3af53156be1e13be19f8551aa0eb9da68c230d20b485287a1c9273",
   "text": "ご存じですか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e25736593d07ce53e422",
   "sourceHash": "e25736593d07ce53e42282028ae43ccdffe8f2b81dad12b950fc53c942d65413",
   "text": "驚くべき事実",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15561c4d2bf9b8a6c2da",
   "sourceHash": "15561c4d2bf9b8a6c2dac297127db89b3b391f9f4e536afb165123c0d056f542",
   "text": "世界保健機関（WHO）の報告によると、加盟194か国のうち170か国以上で伝統医療が用いられています。パンチャカルマは、記録に残る最も古い体系の一つであり、当院の医師が日々実践しているものです。ご自身の体を本格的にケアしたいとお考えになったら、アーユルヴェーダの医師がどこから始めればよいかをご案内します。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_849109ced4396a29e4cb",
   "sourceHash": "849109ced4396a29e4cbeeb72a5bdf72429bc910967faecb60ce5360ed3d7c01",
   "text": "はい、健康になりたいです",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_466c15cbfedce229a3fc",
   "sourceHash": "466c15cbfedce229a3fc7e2fbc3eaf00dfabe592074fe6d2cf3fda0b64082a17",
   "text": "のWHO加盟国が伝統医療の使用を報告 — 194か国中170か国",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following a percentage figure; kept as a trailing fragment."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ae50b76b3de971284951",
   "sourceHash": "ae50b76b3de971284951327c802a806b0446fd0534eeec9d4b7cf15ad222002a",
   "text": "私たちがあなたをサポートします",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
